   "html": "<p>Replicating the tropical island backdrop in the film, IHC developed the ultimate spa experience, complete with free amenities and branded giveaways, to cement both the tagline “Are you having a good time?” and the film itself in the minds of all attendees. </p>\n<p>With colorful backdrops to encourage custom content and complimentary spa services, this impactful activation left all attendees eager to see the film in theaters. </p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "ACTIVITIES & PHOTO MOMENTS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Our Brand Ambassadors, decked out in the same all-white resort wear seen in the film, greeted guests into our lush and luxurious spa oasis, complete with scented candles, infused water, and complimentary popsicles. They could relax in lounge chairs while they enjoyed a cooling blue face mask, naturally recreating an iconic shot from the movie.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Two professional nail technicians provided pool-ready nails, including hand-painted premium press-ons in custom designs inspired by the film’s themes and setting. Staff also took polaroid shots of guests in front of our “living” green photo wall, providing a branded takeaway to remember the fun.</p>"
    },
