  {
   "title": "PARTNERSHIPS & GIVEAWAYS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Guests who stopped by the Lounge were also gifted a branded goodie bag complete with coveted items to stay cool all weekend, relax and unwind.  </p>\n<p>All festival attendees staying at partner hotels were provided a Thrive Kit at check-in. Branded chapstick and sunblock, along with an informational card, alerted guests about both the activation and the film itself, further driving attendance over the weekend. </p>"
